                    flexibility in the IT field because I believe it is crucial
                    to solving practical problems.
                </p>

            <!-- RIGHT SIDE - IMAGE -->
            <div class="col-lg-5 text-center order-1 order-lg-2">

                <img src="~/lib/images/formalpic.jpg"
